# Full-resolution team photo masters — NOT stored in this repo.
# They live outside it (J:\MyDocuments\GitHub\Dragon-Swim\team-photos-originals-backup).
# The site only ever needs the downscaled copies in src/assets/team-photos/,
# which ARE tracked. These patterns are a safety net so that a stray copy of the
# ~30 MB originals can never be committed by accident. They do NOT match
# src/assets/team-photos/.
